    {
      "id": "iBEmyydVpPIYdOPnmzC1n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 62.298182571375705,
      "y": 436.9535513597508,
      "width": 1007.3593139648438,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 545556476,
      "version": 427,
      "versionNonce": 833842940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790598138957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dataclass: \n    - It is a way to create classes that are mainly used to store data, with much less boilerplate code.\n    - It is used for Data Holding classes , making code cleaner and less error-prone.\n    - It is used by `@dataclass` & It has automatic:\n        - `__init__`   :  Decalre Fields with Type ints\n        - `__repr__`  :  Nice Printable Representation\n        - `__eq__`    :  Compares field values",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dataclass: \n    - It is a way to create classes that are mainly used to store data, with much less boilerplate code.\n    - It is used for Data Holding classes , making code cleaner and less error-prone.\n    - It is used by `@dataclass` & It has automatic:\n        - `__init__`   :  Decalre Fields with Type ints\n        - `__repr__`  :  Nice Printable Representation\n        - `__eq__`    :  Compares field values",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aHKsN2_SNWSTomWCZRCS9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72.35779064171064,
      "y": 674.0938444305677,
      "width": 700.9195556640625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2025197820,
      "version": 311,
      "versionNonce": 1319674692,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "hELld175_RhTzYAh-GKcT",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790607431005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CSV vs. Parquet\n\n    - CSV = Comma Separated Values\n        - Plain Text\n        - Storage style ---> Row-based.\n        - It is Human Readable\n        - No built-in schema\n        - Slow query performance on large files\n        - Stores data row by row.\n        - To read-only 1 column -> The computer reads the full entire file",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CSV vs. Parquet\n\n    - CSV = Comma Separated Values\n        - Plain Text\n        - Storage style ---> Row-based.\n        - It is Human Readable\n        - No built-in schema\n        - Slow query performance on large files\n        - Stores data row by row.\n        - To read-only 1 column -> The computer reads the full entire file",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2quEhsVJpzginP0IuaYgM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 93.42186543054734,
      "y": 940.1424234355227,
      "width": 989.359375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2031141828,
      "version": 519,
      "versionNonce": 990698052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790607416582,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Parquet:\n    - Binary\n    - Storage style ---> Columnar\n    - It is not human readable\n    - It has storage schemas (data types, nullability)\n    - Very fast for analytics\n    - Stores data column by column\n    - Read only the columns you need -> Faster and Less Memory --> Column Pruning\n    - Smaller file size than CSV because of (Efficient Ecoding, Built-in Compression, Columnar Storage)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Parquet:\n    - Binary\n    - Storage style ---> Columnar\n    - It is not human readable\n    - It has storage schemas (data types, nullability)\n    - Very fast for analytics\n    - Stores data column by column\n    - Read only the columns you need -> Faster and Less Memory --> Column Pruning\n    - Smaller file size than CSV because of (Efficient Ecoding, Built-in Compression, Columnar Storage)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5nKD2EF8HU2HlQKl6OdMJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 932.3920912448183,
      "y": 904.58297796176,
      "width": 580.6995849609375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1720440388,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 13220164,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "AsWby7SKKryB-WPrBAkDv",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790607440350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Simple rule of thumb:\n    - Small file + Open in Excel --> CSV\n    - Sharing with non-technical people --> CSV\n    - Large data + data lakes --> Parquet\n    - Analytics + Max Performance & Efficiency --> Parquet ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Simple rule of thumb:\n    - Small file + Open in Excel --> CSV\n    - Sharing with non-technical people --> CSV\n    - Large data + data lakes --> Parquet\n    - Analytics + Max Performance & Efficiency --> Parquet ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
